WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:04,240
Auntie, you can also hypnotize zombies. What kind of power is that?

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,850
So what kind of superpower is it?

3
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:08,850
It's the virus spray I developed

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,850
When I was studying the virus, I found that his weakness was resistance to the Ale medicine.

5
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:12,850
I made a recipe

6
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:16,070
Spraying on a zombie's eyes will stop them for one to three seconds.

7
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,070
I ran out of spray last month.

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:21,290
Only then were they caught by those beasts

9
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,290
Get these medicines for my aunt

10
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,320
Auntie will make you some self-defense spray

11
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,320
Ordinary people can also use it and everyone can carry it

12
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:31,320
No wonder I hope the base can withstand so many waves of zombies in the later stage

13
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,320
It was him who I relied on

14
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:35,320
Okay, please give me the drug association

15
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:41,890
I will collect it next time

16
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:43,980
Let them die too easily today

17
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,980
Baby, it's okay

18
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,080
Auntie is not you
